(text "STM32H723ZGT6 CORE (LQFP144)\nDecoupling per ST AN5419: 100nF per VDD pin + 4.7uF bulk, VCAP 2x2.2uF (LDO mode),\nVDDA via ferrite with 1uF+100nF, VREF+ = VDDA. HSE 25 MHz (firmware PLL M=5 N=220 -> 550 MHz).\nFDD flux: RDATA=PA5 TIM2_CH1, INDEX=PA1 TIM2_CH2, WDATA=PA6 TIM3_CH1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "75a9062e-6768-4306-a79d-c75527d85d4a"))
